; Example measurements and activities
;
; This file contains both measurement data (weight, bp, steps) and activity
; data (*) that represent an example day's worth of health/fitness information.
;
; Measurement syntax:
; <date> [time] <metric> <value> [unit] [, <metric> <value> [unit]...]
;   metadata_1: metadata_value
;   metadata_2: metadata_value
;
; Activity syntax:
; <date> [time] * "<description>" [#tags...]
;   metadata_1: metadata_value
;   metadata_2: metadata_value

